{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39690","headline":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 三 · 黄滔","name":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾谊才承宣室召，左思唯预秘书流。\n赋家达者无过此，翰苑今朝是独游。\n立被御炉烟气逼，吟经栈阁雨声秋。\n内人未识江淹笔，竟问当时不早求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}